    },
    "body": "The native compiler's local observations omit ordered source-frame context. Add matched eight-lane H4 prefix-carrier and prefix-to-word transport feature modes, preserve the legacy modes, support the scoped40-slot compiler artifact, and freeze a prospective crossed3 panel.\n\nSix complete paired three-seed fits at source1068cf5f learn every training write and improve matched CP64 value/wording factors. Query/nonwrite regressions remain; development CE selects initialization five times, and every selected fresh store arm completes0/12. The documentation preserves both useful checkpoints and whole-path negatives, answers Claude's leakage/parity/seed/admission audit, and advances native representation/address credit rather than an unchanged head fit.\n\nActual Linux CPU validation at1068cf5f:4 integer,14 training-library and11 driver tests plus optimized build PASS; six complete fits; independent saved-evidence141,472 checks PASS with explicit reexecution exclusions. Final documentation commit changes no tested numerical source. Shared session is untouched. Queue statuses are transport acknowledgements, not tests. The initial storage-interrupted compile and auditor nullable-read defect are retained separately from model outcomes. Full return/member verification and exact execution/resource identities are recorded in the report.\n\nReferences #820, #1552. No general chat/reasoning, consistent geometric-arm advantage or laptop energy claim.\n",
